# Radial and conic gradients on paper, two rows of four 40x40 cells, cells left to right. The conic
# sweep starts at the right (3 o'clock) and runs clockwise: through the bottom, left, then top.
# Row 1 (y 24), radial. Cell 1: radial(gold #e8b33a, plum #2b2440): gold at the center of the square,
# dark plum at the edges and corners, circular bands. Cell 2: the same with at:.3,.3, so the gold center
# sits 30 percent across and down (up and left of the square's center) and the right and bottom edges
# are plum. Cell 3: at:.3,.3 r:20, the same center but plum is reached 20 units out, so the gold spot is
# smaller and the right and bottom third of the cell is solid plum. Cell 4: radial(#fff6d8
# #e0574f,.4 fade(#e0574f 0)) on a plum #2b2440 square: a cream center, red at 40 percent of the radius,
# then fading to transparent so the edges and corners show plum.
# Row 2 (y 72), conic. Cell 1: conic(red #e0574f, blue #4f7fe0): red directly right of the center and
# just below that line, magenta-pink at the bottom and left, violet at the top, blue just above the
# right-hand line, with a hard seam from blue to red along the line to the right. Cell 2: conic of red
# #e0574f, gold #e8b33a, blue #4f7fe0: red at the right, orange and gold across the bottom, green on
# the upper left, cyan at the top, blue just above the right-hand line, with the same seam. Cell 3:
# conic(gold gold,.5 plum,.5 plum): a hard split along the horizontal line through the center, solid
# gold on the bottom half and solid plum on the top half. Cell 4: the same colors as cell 2 on a circle
# of radius 20, so the sectors are clipped round.
@target color/grad_radial_conic.png 192x104
@target color/grad_radial_conic.svg 192x104 profile:svg

rect 40x40 at:24,24 fill:radial(#e8b33a #2b2440)
rect 40x40 at:72,24 fill:radial(#e8b33a #2b2440 at:.3,.3)
rect 40x40 at:120,24 fill:radial(#e8b33a #2b2440 at:.3,.3 r:20)
rect 40x40 at:168,24 fill:#2b2440
rect 40x40 at:168,24 fill:radial(#fff6d8 #e0574f,.4 fade(#e0574f 0))
rect 40x40 at:24,72 fill:conic(#e0574f #4f7fe0)
rect 40x40 at:72,72 fill:conic(#e0574f #e8b33a #4f7fe0)
rect 40x40 at:120,72 fill:conic(#e8b33a #e8b33a,.5 #2b2440,.5 #2b2440)
circle 20 at:168,72 fill:conic(#e0574f #e8b33a #4f7fe0)
